|content1=
* January 25th - '''Mindfreak''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' with a roster consisting of [[cAra]], [[BiBiAhn]], [[Rachel (Australian player)|Rachel]], [[kenshi]], [[Emi (Female player)|Emi]], and [[viridian]], the latter as the team's coach. <ref name="enter cs">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Mindfreak/status/1485870051089551363|title=Introducing the new Mindfreak CS:GO team!|date=2022-01-25|author='''Mindfreak'''}}</ref>
