* July 28th - [[Bay]] steps down from '''Mindfreak''' and is replaced by [[lawlkay]]. <ref name="lawlkay">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/zunecs2/status/2081940366035739033|title=New @Mindfreak CS roster update|date=2026-07-28|author=[[zune]]}}</ref>
